## 3.0.8 (2026-10-27)

### Bugs fixed:

-   fix language swap ReferenceError in translate window
-   fix ChatGLM streaming translation
-   fix invalid proxy port causing startup panic
-   validate plugin type when installing plugins
-   fix hotkey being cleared when focusing the input
-   fix backup failure when Aliyun Drive is not logged in
-   keep the local HTTP server alive on invalid request body
-   skip OCR window when macOS screenshot is cancelled
-   fix dynamic translate debounce, duplicate auto copy and history database races
-   refresh plugin list in opened translate/recognize windows
-   fix OCR service names, instance keys and plugin uninstall cleanup
-   fix screenshot cutting bounds and failure handling

